<title>UK: Dresdner unit sets 150 mln stg Dec 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Dresdner unit sets 150 mln stg Dec 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers BZW and Dresdner Bank-Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DRESDNER FINANCE BV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DRESDNER BANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     7.125 PCT MATURITY    28.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.348   PAY DATE   S11.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.723    SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	S SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA+	 DENOMS (K) 1-10    SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.0 PCT GILT DUE 2001</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
